Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.4.25-rt37 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.4.25 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: 10a2c627c0b9bde10d19ba0815eea6d775953983


Or to build 3.4.25-rt37 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.4.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.4.25.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.4/patch-3.4.25-rt37.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve



